sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor U as Usuário
    participant B as Browser
    participant MW as Next Middleware
    participant P as Next Page (Server Component)
    participant DAL as Auth DAL/RBAC
    participant FE as Front Services
    participant API as Backend API

    U->>B: Acessa rota protegida (/dashboard ou /dashboard/documents)
    B->>MW: HTTP Request + cookies

    alt Sem sessão
        MW-->>B: 302 /login?redirect=...
    else Com sessão
        MW->>API: GET /api/auth/profile (validar sessão)
        alt Sessão inválida
            API-->>MW: 401/403
            MW-->>B: 302 /login + limpa cookies
        else Sessão válida
            API-->>MW: 200 user profile
            MW-->>P: NextResponse.next()

            P->>DAL: requireUser() / requireRole(...)
            DAL->>API: GET /api/auth/profile
            API-->>DAL: user + role

            alt Role sem permissão
                DAL-->>B: redirect('/dashboard' ou '/login')
            else Role permitida
                P->>FE: getDocuments(), getDocumentTypes(), getUsers()
                FE->>API: GET /api/documents
                FE->>API: GET /api/document-types
                FE->>API: GET /api/users
                API-->>FE: dados normalizados
                FE-->>P: items + types + users
                P-->>B: Render DocumentsSection
            end
        end
    end

    rect rgba(220,255,230,0.40)
    Note over U,B: Fluxo client-side em DocumentsSection
    U->>B: Digita "Search collaborator"
    B->>B: groupDocumentsByCollaborator(items, search)
    B-->>U: Lista filtrada por colaborador
    end

    rect rgba(255,240,220,0.45)
    Note over U,API: Ações em documento
    U->>B: Approve / Reject / Delete / View / Edit
    B->>FE: server actions / getDocument / getDocumentForEdit
    FE->>API: PATCH/DELETE/GET documentos
    API-->>FE: resultado
    FE-->>B: toast + router.refresh()
    B-->>U: UI atualizada
    end
